\subsection{Faithfulness}

One of the nine intervals at the gold level excludes zero after correction, namely B1, $\hat{\tau} = +0.031$ with a 95\% interval of $[+0.014, +0.047]$. The same comparison at the retrieved level gives $+0.009$ with an interval that contains zero. A result that appears in one cell and not the other is weak evidence. 

\subsection{Answer Relevance}

No interval excludes zero after correction in either cell. The largest estimate is $+0.012$. Relevance sits between $0.693$ and $0.746$ in every condition and the rewordings do not move it.

